{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以西結蒙召"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那聲音對我說：「人子啊，你站起來，我要對你說話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["正說的時候，耶和華的靈就進入我裡面，使我站起來。我聽見那聲音對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「人子啊，我派你去那背叛我的國民以色列人那裡。他們和他們的祖先至今仍背叛我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我派你到那些心裡剛硬的人那裡，向他們宣告，『主耶和華這樣說。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不管那群叛逆的人聽不聽，他們都會知道有一位先知在他們當中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["人子啊，不要怕他們和他們的話，雖然你周圍佈滿荊棘和毒蠍，也不要害怕。他們是一群叛逆的人，你不要怕他們的話，也不要因為他們的臉色而驚慌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他們是叛逆的，不論他們聽不聽，你都要把我的話告訴他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「人子啊，你要聽我對你說的話，不要像他們那樣叛逆，要張開口吃我賜給你的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這時我觀看，見一隻手向我伸來，手中拿著書卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那隻手把那書卷在我面前打開，書卷的兩面都寫滿了哀傷、歎息和悲痛的話。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}